he first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MaximalCliques","kind":"symbol"}}}